<title>CANADA: Imperial Oil cuts posted oil prices.</title>
<headline>Imperial Oil cuts posted oil prices.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imperial Oil Ltd said it lowered the price it would pay for Edmonton light sweet crude oil by C$5.00/cubic metre or C$0.79/barrel, to C$210.00/cubic metre or C$33.39/barrel, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Other new prices were listed as follows:</p>
<p>Cromer light sour C$204.00/cubic metre, or C$32.43/barrel</p>
<p>Bow River at Hardisty C$171.00/cubic metre, or C$27.19/barrel</p>
<p>Midale at Cromer C$179.00/cubic metre, or C$28.48/barrel</p>
<p>((Reuters Calgary Bureau (403) 531-1624))</p>
